("19. LCM of Two Numbers",
"""Example:
let a = 6, b = 8;
let x = a, y = b;
while(b != 0){
  let t = b;
  b = a % b;
  a = t;
}
let lcm = (x*y)/a;
console.log(lcm);

Output:
24
"""),

("20. Fibonacci Series",
"""Example:
